<title>UK: Alumax elects new officer for strategic planning.</title>
<headline>Alumax elects new officer for strategic planning.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alumax Inc said on Wednesday that its board had elected Michael T. Vollkommer as vice-president, strategic planning and corporate development.</p>
<p>In a release received here, Alumax said Vollkommer, previously vice-president and controller, will report to board chairman Allen Born.</p>
<p>Alumax also said that Kevin J. Krakora, has been elected as vice-president and controller. Krakora was previously vice-president finance of Kawneer Co Inc, a wholly-owned Alumax subsidiary.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom 44 171 542 8080</p>
</text>
